<title>SPAIN: Spain calls Deng original and historic figure.</title>
<headline>Spain calls Deng original and historic figure.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Prime Minister Jose Maria Aznar sent a telegram of condolence to China on the death on Wednesday of its leader Deng Xiaoping, whom he praised as an original and historic figure.</p>
<p>&quot;His innovative political work will occupy a deserved place in contemporary history,&quot; Aznar said in the published text of the telegram. &quot;The memory of such a distinguished personality will endure for generations.&quot;</p>
<p>Spain's king and queen also sent a telegram expressing their condolences.</p>
</text>
